Scanned documents and photographs
----------------------------------
The binary scans in evidence/ are reproductions of archival records held by
third-party institutions (FamilySearch, Arquivo Público Mineiro, COARPE/TJMG,
Hemeroteca Digital/Biblioteca Nacional, BPAR Angra do Heroísmo, and various
Brazilian civil, parish, and notarial registers). Each scan is subject to the
originating institution's own terms of use; this licence does not grant any
rights over those materials. Rights to the originals remain with the respective
institutions.

For reproduction or commercial use of archival records, contact the relevant
archive directly.
